 \n保持服装/发型一致，背景延续原图户外晴天自然光，原始视角参考正面中景；表情改为抿嘴笑，姿势调整为交叉双臂站立，拍摄角度为侧面45°；写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。  \n保持服装/发型一致，背景延续原图户外晴天自然光，原始视角参考正面中景；表情改为严肃凝视，姿势调整为单手插兜侧身，拍摄角度为低角度平视；写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。  \n...（共10条）", 1024, false, 952575544009617, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 499, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 245, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [498], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "COMBO", "label": "COMBO", "type": "*", "localized_name": "COMBO"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["text", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 497, "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"n